 echoSrv;r1;data
 CS.Bind
 ⎕←h←CS.Init''
 ⎕←CS.Srv h'S1' '' 8080 'Command' 16384  ⍝ create + start server

 ⎕←CS.Wait h'S1' 50000       ⍝ server connect
 :While 1
     r1←CS.Wait h'S1' 5000       ⍝ wait for next event
     data←0(220⌶)4⊃r1
     data←1(220⌶)100+data
     {}CS.Respond h(⊃r1)data
 :EndWhile
